            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "逆文件頻率（IDF, Inverse Document Frequency）：衡量該詞在整體語料庫中的稀有程度。\n\nIDF(t, D) = log(∏(D | ( |{d ∈ D : t ∈ d} |))",
            "block_bbox": [
